<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Admin Paneli - Cumhuriyet RP Bot</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500;700;900&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-red: #C41E3A;
            --dark-red: #8B1429;
            --text-dark: #2C2C2C;
            --text-muted: #7A7A7A;
            --bg-light: #F5F5F5;
            --success: #27ae60;
            --warning: #f39c12;
            --danger: #e74c3c;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C41E3A 0%, #8B1429 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            position: relative;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width="60" height="60" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"%3E%3Cpath d="M30 0l5 10h10l-8 6 3 10-10-7-10 7 3-10-8-6h10z" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.03)"/%3E%3C/svg%3E') repeat;
            opacity: 0.3;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .top-bar {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .top-bar h1 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--primary-red);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .top-bar .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .btn-logout {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C41E3A 0%, #8B1429 100%);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
        }

        .btn-logout:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.3);
        }

        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .stat-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 4px;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--primary-red);
        }

        .stat-card:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .stat-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .stat-title {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 500;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .stat-icon {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: white;
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        }

        .stat-label {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .kanun-section {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .section-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bg-light);
        }

        .section-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .kanun-item {
            background: var(--bg-light);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            border-left: 4px solid transparent;
        }

        .kanun-item:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-left-color: var(--primary-red);
        }

        .kanun-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: start;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        .kanun-id {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: var(--primary-red);
            color: white;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .kanun-title {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }

        .kanun-meta {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .status-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .status-yürürlükte {
            background: #d4edda;
            color: #155724;
        }

        .status-oylamada {
            background: #d1ecf1;
            color: #0c5460;
        }

        .status-taslak {
            background: #fff3cd;
            color: #856404;
        }

        .status-reddedildi {
            background: #f8d7da;
            color: #721c24;
        }

        .kanun-date {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .action-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            border-top: 2px solid var(--bg-light);
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3498db 0%, #2980b9 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.3);
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 3rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: white;
        }

        .empty-state {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .empty-state svg {
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            fill: #ddd;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container {
                padding: 1rem;
            }

            .top-bar {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .stats-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .section-header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
                align-items: start;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="top-bar">
            <div>
                <h1>
                    🛡️ Admin Paneli
                </h1>
                <div class="subtitle">Cumhuriyet RP Bot v1.1.1 Yönetim Merkezi</div>
            </div>
            <form action="/admin/logout" method="POST" style="margin: 0;">
                <button type="submit" class="btn-logout">
                    🚪 Çıkış Yap
                </button>
            </form>
        </div>

        <div class="stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-header">
                    <div class="stat-title">Yürürlükte</div>
                    <div class="stat-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #27ae60, #219a52);">
                        ✓
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-number"><%= kanunlar.filter(k => k.durum === 'Yürürlükte').length %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">Aktif Kanun</div>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-header">
                    <div class="stat-title">Oylamada</div>
                    <div class="stat-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3498db, #2980b9);">
                        🗳️
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-number"><%= kanunlar.filter(k => k.durum === 'Oylamada').length %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">Oylanan</div>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-header">
                    <div class="stat-title">Taslak</div>
                    <div class="stat-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f39c12, #e67e22);">
                        📝
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-number"><%= kanunlar.filter(k => k.durum === 'Taslak').length %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">Hazırlanan</div>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-header">
                    <div class="stat-title">Reddedilen</div>
                    <div class="stat-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e74c3c, #c0392b);">
                        ✕
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-number"><%= kanunlar.filter(k => k.durum === 'Reddedildi').length %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">Ret</div>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-header">
                    <div class="stat-title">Memnuniyet</div>
                    <div class="stat-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9b59b6, #8e44ad);">
                        😊
                    </div>
                </div>
                <% 
                const memnuniyetRenk = oyunDurumu.memnuniyet_seviyesi >= 75 ? '#27ae60' : oyunDurumu.memnuniyet_seviyesi >= 50 ? '#f39c12' : '#e74c3c';
                %>
                <div class="stat-number" style="color: <%= memnuniyetRenk %>;">
                    <%= oyunDurumu.memnuniyet_seviyesi %>%
                </div>
                <div class="stat-label">
                    <% if (oyunDurumu.isyan_aktif) { %>
                        ⚠️ İsyan Aktif
                    <% } else { %>
                        ✌️ Barış
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-header">
                    <div class="stat-title">Toplam</div>
                    <div class="stat-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #34495e, #2c3e50);">
                        📊
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-number"><%= kanunlar.length %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">Kanun</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="kanun-section">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2 class="section-title">
                    ⚖️ Kanun Yönetimi
                </h2>
            </div>

            <% if (kanunlar.length === 0) { %>
                <div class="empty-state">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-5 14H7v-2h7v2zm3-4H7v-2h10v2zm0-4H7V7h10v2z"/>
                    </svg>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-dark);">Henüz Kanun Yok</h3>
                    <p>Discord botunu kullanarak yeni kanun teklifleri oluşturabilirsiniz.</p>
                </div>
            <% } else { %>
                <% kanunlar.forEach(k => { %>
                    <div class="kanun-item">
                        <div class="kanun-header">
                            <div class="kanun-id">
                                #<%= k.id %>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="kanun-title">
                            <%= k.baslik %>
                        </div>
                        <div class="kanun-meta">
                            <span class="status-badge status-<%= k.durum.toLowerCase() %>">
                                <% if (k.durum === 'Taslak') { %>
                                    📝 Taslak
                                <% } else if (k.durum === 'Oylamada') { %>
                                    🗳️ Oylamada
                                <% } else if (k.durum === 'Yürürlükte') { %>
                                    ✓ Yürürlükte
                                <% } else if (k.durum === 'Reddedildi') { %>
                                    ✕ Reddedildi
                                <% } %>
                            </span>
                            <% if (k.zaman) { %>
                                <span class="kanun-date">
                                    📅 <%= new Date(k.zaman).toLocaleDateString('tr-TR') %>
                                </span>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                <% }); %>
            <% } %>

            <div class="action-buttons">
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">
                    🏠 Ana Sayfa
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            🛡️ Admin Panel - Cumhuriyet RP Bot v1.1.1
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
